@title A neutral wire that is not blue is listed in Issues under IEC 60204-1
@area Reports
# The fixture is the example with its wires coloured by the Autopilot and one neutral wire set to black.
open qa/fixtures/neutral-black.novo
wait 20
click_text "warning"
wait 10
expect "IEC 60204-1 gives BU"
shot issues-neutral-not-blue
check_blank issues-neutral-not-blue
check_layout
# A click on the row goes to the wire on its page and marks it.
click_text "Wire 19 (Neutral circuit) is BK; IEC 60204-1 gives BU"
wait 10
shot neutral-wire-marked
check_blank neutral-wire-marked
check_layout
